<title>USA: McKesson sees $100 mln new revs in VHA deal.</title>
<headline>McKesson sees $100 mln new revs in VHA deal.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp said Tuesday it expects new revenue in excess of $100 million in the first year of a new deal for its McKesson Health Systems to provide pharmaceutical products to VHA health care centers.</p>
<p>The company said the three year deal is effective immediatey.</p>
<p>VHA, headquartered in Irving, Texas, is a national health care network representing more than 1,500 health care organizations and their affiliated physicians.</p>
